bp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1ea4e0d1d0807f297dc608ff6733082 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=248c870009c09a9eea6ecc42e5ed87b3 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "mof.様\n初めまして、こんにちは。\nVtuber準備中の始終（はじめ しゅう）と申します。\n\n検索を通じてmof.様の楽曲に出会い、その素敵な音楽の数々に感銘を受け、この度ご連絡させていただきました。ぜひ楽曲制作をご依頼したく存じます。\n\n●依頼内容\nYouTubeやX（旧Twitter）用のBGM\nまだまだ先になりますが、収益化予定です。\n\n●イメージ\n「おいでよ どうぶつの森」の午後9時のような儚い雰囲気の曲を希望しております。\n可愛すぎず、聴いていてどこか懐かしさを感じられるような楽曲が理想です。\nピアノやアコースティックギターなどを織り交ぜていただけると幸いです。\n\n●参考曲\nhttps://skeb.jp/@mof_mof_moof_/works/22\nhttps://skeb.jp/@mof_mof_moof_/works/50\nhttps://skeb.jp/@mof_mof_moof_/works/40\n\n出来ればループが出来るようにしてくださると幸いです。\n\n楽曲の依頼が初めてのため、不明点や失礼がございましたら申し訳ございません。\n何卒ご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mof_mof_moof_/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1ea4e0d1d0807f297dc608ff6733082 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=248c870009c09a9eea6ecc42e5ed87b3 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! Your music is really beautiful, I hope to ask for a piece inspired by my character, using Chinese instruments\n\nHe is an exorcist whose work is to seal yokai, and he is able to see yokai although he is blind. The skill is inherited from his family who come from a long line of famous exorcists. He is in poor health, and often wonders if he will survive each winter, but he has an independent and reserved personality and doesn’t like to burden others. He is very kind as well. He has a few close friends, but sometimes feels lonely. His work can be quite dangerous as he may run into things or be harmed by yokai. The setting is in the 1930s, with a chinese aesthetic, where dangerous yokai need to be sealed away by exorcists through rituals. \n\nHere are some visual reference you can use as inspiration if you like:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11-_gUyeu8-4ElK0e8rlfqRUsuRCQmN3g\n\nhttps://pin.it/7wGg7GHNV\n\nThank you for considering my request, I hope you can create freely!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mof_mof_moof_/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1ea4e0d1d0807f297dc608ff6733082 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=248c870009c09a9eea6ecc42e5ed87b3 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "mof.様 \n\nXでは相互さんですが、一応初めまして。VTuber準備中の牝羊、メアリー・オヴィサリエスと申します。\n実は隠れファンで、私のオリジナルBGMはmof.様にお願いしたいと決めていたのですが、ついに意を決してこのたびリクエストに伺いました次第です！\n\n𖦹用途𖦹 \nYouTube https://youtube.com/@melizabeth_atelier などで朗読動画や配信BGMへの使用\n\n𖦹内容𖦹\nループ仕様BGM 1曲\n(もし可能でしたら、画面切り替え用にジングルサイズ、ED https://youtu.be/b2OLBfFo6yc?feature=shared 用にオルゴールアレンジも作成していただけましたら幸いです)\n\n𖦹イメージ𖦹\n【もりのなか】のアトリエ兼【雑貨屋さん】で、時計の【秒針】をBGMにしながら、【ゆめみごこち】でハンドメイドに勤しむ【穏やかな日】\n文章に組み込んだ上記タイトル、どれも好きな曲です！\n\n金額が見合わなければ再送してください。\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mof_mof_moof_/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=249f54c47cd484116db43047a2963407, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1ea4e0d1d0807f297dc608ff6733082 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1828815998558027776%2F9PDHenXh.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=248c870009c09a9eea6ecc42e5ed87b3 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。先日